{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前無綫小花朱智賢近日亮相HOY TV節目《九運會客室2》，為2020年車廂偷食事件作出驚人自白。她在訪問中聲淚 …</p><p></p>\n<p>前無綫小花朱智賢近日亮相HOY TV節目《九運會客室2》，為2020年車廂偷食事件作出驚人自白。她在訪問中聲淚俱下暗示前男友疑似出軌在先，令自己失去安全感才行差踏錯。這番遲來的指控不但未能成功洗白，反而引發大批網民群起圍攻。</p>\n<h2>朱智賢爆喊揭偷食原因 暗指謝東閔行蹤飄忽</h2>\n<p>朱智賢接受由伍詠薇與李凱賢主持訪問時情緒激動，重提當年背着男友與太太臨盆在即香港先生黎振燁幽會一事。當被追問為何發生偷食蛋糕風波時，她直指與前任關係早現裂痕：「本身係Sweet嘅，跟住就⋯⋯發生咗啲事啦，自此之後所有嘢就變曬咁，因為我開始變到無咗個Trust」更爆喊暗指男方行蹤飄忽令她失去信任。她在節目中用廣憶述：「你知女人嘅第六感，有少少sense到，會留意到另一半有啲行為有啲唔同，你開始sense到有啲習慣改變咗，或者成日唔見咗人，唔得閒。」她坦言自己處理感情極差，並在鏡頭前承認當年確曾做錯事。</p>\n<h2>謝東閔不反擊舊愛指控 大方送上祝福</h2>\n<p>面對舊愛在熒幕前連番暗示控訴，謝東閔回應傳媒時表現得相當大方得體，並未有對當年事件作出任何反擊。他僅平靜地表示：「過去嘅事情，過去就讓他過去，大家往前看就好了，希望佢以後幸福快樂。」言出必行的他目前已經全面轉戰大灣區飲食界，在廣州開設時尚串燒餐廳並進入試業階段。榮升老闆後他更親自坐鎮新店，獲圈中好兄弟麥長青、金剛及關楚耀輪流現身試食撐場，現場星光熠熠氣氛熱鬧。</p>\n<h2>謝東閔當年不離不棄 陪朱智賢開記者會承擔責任</h2>\n<p>回顧這段糾纏多年的三角關係，2020年爆發車廂偷食事件後，謝東閔曾頂住極大輿論壓力，親自陪同女方出席道歉記者會面對傳媒。當時他甚至將部分責任攬上身，多年來一直默默承受外界各種冷嘲熱諷，陪伴對方度過事業與形象谷底。經歷漫長感情拉扯後，兩人才終於在前年正式宣布分手，當時男方更發文強調雙方有共識會以不同身分繼續守護對方。</p>\n<h2>舊事重提惹怒網民炮轟恩將仇報</h2>\n<p>這次深情剖白不但未獲大眾同情，反而觸發大規模網絡公關災難。大批網民留言洗版力撐男方早已仁至義盡，狠批女方如今突然重提舊事企圖轉移視線。有網民憤怒直斥：「就算感情有問題都唔係做第三者嘅藉口！」更有不少人認為當年另一男主角早已淡出幕前回歸家庭，現時再次翻舊帳，會對已退圈當事人及其妻兒造成二次傷害。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596740869495_9315725426af44f40452dc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596740869495_9315725426af44f40452dc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596895046328_19047758416af44f4148fb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596895046328_19047758416af44f4148fb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596999914955_1960425356af44f42be1bd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596999914955_1960425356af44f42be1bd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597165478448_2170603746af44f44306fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597165478448_2170603746af44f44306fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597294275490_14843029606af44f454c1cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597294275490_14843029606af44f454c1cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597395560057_13524042436af44f465f35e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597395560057_13524042436af44f465f35e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597497790890_1520262666af44f47511be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597497790890_1520262666af44f47511be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597568614303_12198076176af44f4822ab6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597568614303_12198076176af44f4822ab6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/-2024-04-29-11.52.45_326685270662f1af52cb04-1024x709.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 黎振燁與朱智賢因《食腦喪B》撻著。（圖片來源：YouTube@ TVB (official)）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/-2024-04-29-11.52.45_326685270662f1af52cb04-1024x709.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黎振燁與朱智賢因《食腦喪B》撻著。（圖片來源：YouTube@ TVB (official)）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179429081743977306_579612256af2b481dce4c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 朱智賢坦言一早知道黎振燁已婚，原本亦認為雙方根本冇可能進一步發展，但因為男方當年一句「已經分居」，成為朱智賢心軟嘅關鍵！（圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179429081743977306_579612256af2b481dce4c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>朱智賢坦言一早知道黎振燁已婚，原本亦認為雙方根本冇可能進一步發展，但因為男方當年一句「已經分居」，成為朱智賢心軟嘅關鍵！（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968901126488_185914625269cdd43a4f498.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 傳媒記招不設提問，有在場採訪資深行家都不禁表示「偷食道歉記招嚟講、呢份稿都寫得算差」！（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968901126488_185914625269cdd43a4f498.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傳媒記招不設提問，有在場採訪資深行家都不禁表示「偷食道歉記招嚟講、呢份稿都寫得算差」！（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968885721615_190740293969cdd438cc98b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 謝東閔表示呢段時間會多啲陪朱智賢，希望可以陪佢「走過呢個階段」。（圖片來源：TVB 娛樂新聞台 TVB Entertainment News）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968885721615_190740293969cdd438cc98b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>謝東閔表示呢段時間會多啲陪朱智賢，希望可以陪佢「走過呢個階段」。（圖片來源：TVB 娛樂新聞台 TVB Entertainment News）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b9%9d%e9%81%8b%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%a2%e5%ae%a42/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九運會客室2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9c%b1%e6%99%ba%e8%b3%a2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">朱智賢</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ac%9d%e6%9d%b1%e9%96%94/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">謝東閔</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：HOYTV、YouTube@ TVB (official、東方新地、TVB 娛樂新聞台 TVB Entertainment News資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540559\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:38:06.043606+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1726,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:19:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:54.707739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:31:37.803848+00:00","content_hash":"39d8d096ff1b370fd088bd9558fd8d4c0cc867748c28ce1597c011d95f6d063b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}